sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant API as Express API
    participant SVC as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: Registration
    U->>API: POST /auth/register
    API->>API: validate input (Zod)
    API->>SVC: register(email, password, name, role)
    SVC->>SVC: hash password (bcrypt)
    SVC->>DB: userRepo.create(user)
    DB-->>SVC: user record (status=pending)
    SVC-->>API: { id, email, status: "pending" }
    API-->>U: 201 Created

    Note over U,DB: Admin Approval
    actor A as Admin
    A->>API: PATCH /auth/users/:id/approve
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(admin)
    API->>SVC: approveUser(userId)
    SVC->>DB: userRepo.update(id, { status: "active" })
    DB-->>SVC: updated user
    SVC-->>API: { status: "active" }
    API-->>A: 200 OK

    Note over U,DB: Login
    U->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>API: validate input
    API->>SVC: login(email, password)
    SVC->>DB: userRepo.findByEmail(email)
    DB-->>SVC: user record
    SVC->>SVC: bcrypt.compare(password)
    SVC->>SVC: jwt.sign({ id, email, role })
    SVC-->>API: { token, user }
    API-->>U: 200 OK

    Note over U,DB: Authenticated Request
    U->>API: GET /api/resource + Bearer token
    API->>API: authenticate middleware
    API->>API: jwt.verify(token)
    API->>API: authorize(roles)
    API->>API: route handler
    API-->>U: response
